/* My best photographs, newest first, in groups: the summer of 2025, the
   semester abroad, summer in NYC, Clinton, Connecticut, and last the
   oldest set (the winter shoots). The order was set by hand -
   re-sorting by the capture dates in the files would scramble it, so don't sort by
   them. No captions: the photos stand on their own.
   The AVIFs are HDR exports, kept in HDR like the rest of the site - but
   only in the viewer. In the album grid each one shows its -thumb.jpg, a
   plain SDR copy, so no photo glows brighter than its neighbours and pulls
   the eye before anyone has chosen to open it.
   ratio (width / height) lets the album lay each row out at one height
   without waiting for the photos to load - see `justified` in
   ProjectSlider.jsx. */
